# Remove concatenated affiliation/location IRIs and replace them with separately modeled, source-supported resources.
# Chess and Kuromarimo profiles list Bliking Pirates and former Drum Kingdom independently; Chessmarimo is a fusion form with no direct group-membership profile.
# Concelot profile confirms the Musketeer Squad; the merged label also included an unsupported Alliance component, which remains unknown.
# Official episode 786 places the Choco Police in Chocolat Town; Colscon is classified as an ally of Whitebeard rather than core crew.
@prefix op: <http://kalnassag.com/onepiece#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

op:Chess op:affiliatesWith op:Bliking_PiratesDrum_Kingdom .

op:Chessmarimo op:affiliatesWith op:Bliking_PiratesDrum_Kingdom .

op:Choco_Police op:residence op:Chocolat_Town_Cacao_IslandTotto_Land .

op:Colscon op:affiliatesWith op:Whitebeard_Pirates .

op:Concelot op:affiliatesWith op:Inuarashi_Musketeer_SquadNinja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai_Alliance .

op:Kuromarimo op:affiliatesWith op:Bliking_PiratesDrum_Kingdom .

op:Chocolat_Town_Cacao_IslandTotto_Land a op:Location .

op:Inuarashi_Musketeer_SquadNinja-Pirate-Mink-Samurai_Alliance a op:Affiliation ;
    rdfs:comment "disbanded"@en .

op:Bliking_PiratesDrum_Kingdom a op:Affiliation ;
    rdfs:comment "disbanded"@en .

